{"steam_appid":3337140,"steam_name":"After Inc: Revival","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337140/1264872193/7aa72a08b9560ad0e2ef5aaa350749df798969de/1785930673/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786450359","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257392274/47dff48efe8701b543f9616dad4861da9a8496cd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786450359","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/a35c7bba3c9f7e6053ed153788f0c25afdda6ad3/ss_a35c7bba3c9f7e6053ed153788f0c25afdda6ad3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786542328","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/679c0706568c2bdc7d05dd5e1703c46d49f7d919/ss_679c0706568c2bdc7d05dd5e1703c46d49f7d919.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786542328","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/73a9cd46d79dd2ef98cc3f383012c0c2dcd0b420/ss_73a9cd46d79dd2ef98cc3f383012c0c2dcd0b420.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786542328","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/7fd13f7fa8311ad3109b31d015e7c89af995f7b0/ss_7fd13f7fa8311ad3109b31d015e7c89af995f7b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786542328","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/95b348097728d63c4ff2d8f15d340dd73b16ff02/ss_95b348097728d63c4ff2d8f15d340dd73b16ff02.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786542328"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens after Plague Inc. wipes out the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after the Necroa Virus ravaged humanity, a few survivors emerge. Build a settlement, explore, scavenge resources and expand as you shape your post-apocalyptic society. The world is green and beautiful, but danger lurks in the ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/057a71bd9a82fc28a13d35f209c1df7e.poster.avif?t=1786542328\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/057a71bd9a82fc28a13d35f209c1df7e.webm?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/057a71bd9a82fc28a13d35f209c1df7e.mp4?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/f1e87c40a45ae97125518dfb62445981.avif?t=1786542328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras_big/f1e87c40a45ae97125518dfb62445981.webp?t=1786542328 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Inc: Revival is the next game from the creator of Plague Inc. - one of the most popular games ever with over 190 million players. Brilliantly executed with beautiful graphics and critically acclaimed gameplay – After Inc: Revival is engaging and easy to learn. Build multiple settlements and gain abilities across multiple campaigns to lead humanity out of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public Service Announcement: Unlike our other games, I’m pleased to say that After Inc: Revival is not based on any real-world situation. No need to start worrying about a real-life zombie apocalypse yet…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/c3cb33b0db952818d86212d738088cf8.poster.avif?t=1786542328\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/c3cb33b0db952818d86212d738088cf8.webm?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/c3cb33b0db952818d86212d738088cf8.mp4?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/75c0b9adfe53d7cec57143410d2216cd.avif?t=1786542328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras_big/75c0b9adfe53d7cec57143410d2216cd.webp?t=1786542328 width=1560 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge into a broken world and build a thriving society in each new level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, scavenge, and harvest new resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build firepits, kitchens, workshops and more to appease your settlers’ needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult decisions - Are children an unaffordable luxury? Are dogs pets or a food source? Democracy or Authoritarianism?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and upgrade Fighters. Exterminate the zombie infestations. Defend humanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/acd138e66ba851d07d425bddd82ff700.poster.avif?t=1786542328\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/acd138e66ba851d07d425bddd82ff700.webm?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/acd138e66ba851d07d425bddd82ff700.mp4?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/0324e0f6ba8ff60416d7a55d62b467d7.avif?t=1786542328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras_big/0324e0f6ba8ff60416d7a55d62b467d7.webp?t=1786542328 width=1560 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build multiple settlements in a persistent world and develop a civilization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the truth of what happened to the world across 3 campaigns spanning 28 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on new content every day in Expeditions to unique, dangerous regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your civilization with 11 Settlement Leaders, 16 Population Traits, and over 700 rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test yourself with community leaderboards, as well as 9 difficulty levels, from Casual all the way to Mega-Brutal 6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/80e4b3fea80c054d636fd466d2792cf1.poster.avif?t=1786542328\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/80e4b3fea80c054d636fd466d2792cf1.webm?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/80e4b3fea80c054d636fd466d2792cf1.mp4?t=1786542328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/36fb61ab15888b807d4c6baa83c1d62a.avif?t=1786542328\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras_big/36fb61ab15888b807d4c6baa83c1d62a.webp?t=1786542328 width=1560 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode: Build endlessly without Goals or Impatience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape Hatch mode: Replay remixed versions of each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Scenarios: Use the powerful Scenario Creator and share your scenarios with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop support: Browse and play scenarios made by other players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful post-apocalyptic <span class=\"bb_strike\">United Kingdom</span> <i>Abandoned Kingdom</i></p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0GHz i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 / R9 270x<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation","Strategy","Early Access"],"developers":["Ndemic Creations"],"publishers":["Ndemic Creations"],"release_date":"17 Jun, 2025"}